      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "33cce9eadb730b9b93e04ea5f56f8bd84d0ed861e866566b46c67d4d6fbed3fb:000002_7906464307362212638:g0:r24",
      "row_index_0based": 24,
      "serialized_row_index": 24,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "なんでも、ずっと観察していたゲシュペンス島を、\n改めて自分の足で歩いてみたいと思ったらしい。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
